Richard Pearson: US Torture Victim Describes Unsettling, Never-Before-Disclosed DetailsDr. Richard Pearson is an intellectual despite being tortured. He shares additional details from his torture account.1. “Luscious Breasts” and Mind Control
Richard Pearson has a big heart. He has over 20 years of community volunteerism, dating to high school. Despite his torture, he began concerned about an elderly homeless woman. He remembered seeing her when he first moved to his neighborhood over ten years ago next to a local fire station. “I had only seen her a few times, but I never passed her. I was always on the main road. I saw her when I first moved but didn’t see her after that.” Thus, Pearson was surprised when he saw her in the local grocery store. He began asking questions around the community and built a rapport with her. He engaged city housing agencies and the local city council. By the time the snow storm arrived in Washington, DC in late January 2026, she was still homeless.“I asked her the morning after the snow began to fall, ‘Where did you stay last night’?” The lady said that she slept at the entrance of the closed metro station. Pearson invited her to his home. “The snow was already inches deep! I had a moral obligation.” Pearson helped the woman with getting to his apartment. They struggled through the snow. The woman settled in. “She slept the first 12 hours.”On the second day, Pearson says something disturbing happened. Until now, he had experienced voice insertions. He knew that they were external. He hadn’t yet pieced together the clicking in his head caused by a device that he did not consent to have placed there.“Look at her luscious breasts”.Pearson is gay. He is exclusively attracted to men. There would be no reason for this internal dialogue. Besides, Pearson does not use words like “luscious”. “Honestly, I didn’t know what was going on in the moment — I didn't reflect on it all that much that I can recall. You have to understand that I had just returned from my attempted asylum to Europe. I was still being tortured. I didn’t think about it much. The whole experience was very disturbing and traumatic. I am just trying to help an elderly lady. This is some otherworldly kind of evil.” Pearson notes that he slept in the walk-in closet while giving her the living room/bedroom to the lady. “I wanted her to feel comfortable — at home.”That was then. Now, Pearson has an entirely different interpretation. “First, of all, they were using voice insertion. It only increased after that! The horror! Inserted videos, images, even music! Second, it is clearly homophobic domestic terrorisism.”Pearson says that the homophobia manifested in many ways, but not just involving him. “I have told this story before, but it bears repeating. I saw a gay man seated next to me struggling to keep his eyes off of two coworkers’ breasts during a lunch break. It was very uncomfortable to watch. After having inserted stuff, being pinned or forced to move, and other forms of violence, I am highly confident that it was some sort of neutrotechnology targeting gay men. I see him as a victim, so I discreetly took a picture. I hope he gets justice some day.” Pearson feels that the same has been done to him — and more. “Absolutely. The level of homophobia is disgusting. This form of evil. They put child pornography in my dream, immediately followed by Black straight pornography.” They put child pornography to keep with a storyline that they manufactured to justify sheer terror against Pearson — a “rumor” that mobilized scores of people against him, even electrocuting him in the groin. “I have never ever in my life watched child pornography. I cannot say the same of my assailants — what pedophiles!”Pearson can describe the dream in details. Two important details are the Black woman in bed with the Black man had her breasts exposed, but other than the no private parts were shown — for the children or the man. The second part is that the man was wearing pants. It wasn’t the only graphic sexual dream that they inserted where the man was wearing pants. “They inserted a rape video! A rape video! I was being raped and the man was wearing a shirt pants during intercourse.” Pearson emphasizes “during”.Pearson says that it is yet another revelation about the kind of technology that is being used. “So here is the list — pinning or being forced to go to a location, being made to sit/stand, made to steal, forced head movements, forced verbal speech, override typing, inserted dreams (including pornography), inserted voices/thoughts, and inserted music.” Pearson is increasingly drawn to a theory of a “consciousness” channel as the hack into people’s minds.2. “Turn Left. Turn Left. Turn Left. Turn Left.”
There is a related story to the elderly homeless woman. “I was in the walk-in closet, which is close to the elevator. It was well into the evening. I kept hearing, “Turn left. Turn left. Turn left. Turn left. Turn left. It repeated like a dozen times. It wasn’t a song. It was robotic, like directions.” Initially, Pearson thought that it was part of the campaign — to saturate his space. He now has a different perspective. “I struggled with why I was hearing this. The lady was asleep in the living room. I was struggling to sleep — it’s the PTSD. I think she had some kind of tracker on her person!” Pearson says that it could have been a brain chip/tracker like the device in his head or something on her person, like in her bag. “I hadn’t heard it before or since. Strange, right?” Pearson notes that the woman has been homeless for 15–20 years with intermittent housing.3. “Sleep on the Right Side. It’s Easier on the Heart”
Pearson had regularly gone to his local grocery store to update his Medium account. He regularly ran into an older African man. Once, they had a longer conversation, but otherwise the exchanges were brief. Pearson now avoids updating his Medium account at the grocery store. “So, I had been going for months. I would see him often. Then, one day, he comes in. He said hi, then I said hi. Then, he said hi again. The tone was not exactly aggressive, but aggressive — he firmly wanted my attention. He was dressed in all red. I guess he’s trying to signal something. I went back to writing. I couldn’t care less. Later on, he said, “Sleep on the right side. It’s easier on the heart.” “It came out of nowhere. We weren’t talking about health or sleep. Nothing of the sort. It was some sort of threat.” Pearson recalled in an earlier conversation with the man — he shared that he knew a lot of people, admitting even that Pearson’s questions raised his suspicions. “It’s was just regular conversation! I don’t get why people are acting like this — the paranoia, the violence, the threats.”4. “Total Power and Control”
Pearson is usually an outdoors person, always on his bike and exploring the city. He is the opposite of a homebody, but he was being more and more limited to his apartment. “This is what they wanted — to use all of this technology — the inserted voices, the dreams, the social isolation, the poor diet and exercise. It’s a page out of hitlerism 101. Pearson also wrote a lot. He usually does not keep a journal, but he amassed several. “My brain was going into overdrive. Torture.” Pearson says that on a single page last summer or fall, he wrote “Total Power and Control” in capitalized letters. “That may have been them really — in my thoughts. Intellectually, I don’t think in such dichotomous terms.” Pearson sees some evidence that it could have been their communication to him. “Look at all of what they did to me! It supports that it is their claim of ‘total power and control’. It’s not only that such technology exists, but is being used on citizens! It’s an autocracy!”5. Messages in His Apartment
Individuals have intruded into Pearson’s apartment many times. The first that he noticed was when the button to his panini grill was taken out and put in his dirty clothes pile. Then, they rearranged a pile of family photos to put his sister and niece on top. Then, they put in messages on his ceiling and his door. “The one on the ceiling told me not to get to Europe. Then, other messages about “gamma”. I have a copy of the illustration, which I traced on paper before wiping the screen door. There were others.” Pearson says that he feels like it’s like zombies. “I just can't get this out of my head — how I feel that many have become zombies.” Pearson is serious.6. “The Government Let’s Us Use This Channel”
With Pearson often sequestered in his apartment for continued torture, the voices increased. Pearson talks about one particular episode. “I was in the bathroom. Then, it seems like there are a bunch of people trying to talk. They seemed like African Americans. They are saying that I am causing them to risk having access to a channel that they use. They wanted the channel, but that the government might shut it down. I am not hallucinating at all. This really happened. They are psychotic, right?” Pearson is not yet aware of the ruse. He engages them, “What do you all do here? Are you trying to help people?” According to Pearson, the answer was evident — no.Pearson now has a different understanding entirely. “First of all, it’s all just the same torture and violence. Second, they were trying to encourage a psychiatric disorder. Third, no such channel exists. They want me to be persuaded, but that’s not what is really happening.” Pearson is not buying any of it and notes subsequent actions that exposed the ruse. “First, as I described in this essay, they taunted me, with this Black man with the “1,000 Voices” book at the library. Such a book does not exist. They knew what they were doing — being inside my head. The second experience is when a man telepathically communicated with me without any awareness. I just described this the other day. They are in people’s heads, literally!Pearson explains that he passed the maintenance man at his apartment outdoors, then a voice, “The cavalry is coming.” Pearson has high confidence was it was brain-to-brain transmission since the leading science in the public literature shows that remote brain-to-brain communication is possible across distances without implants. Government science is often decades ahead.Pearson’s description of the incident is deeply alarming. Pearson, himself, is cognitively and intellectually healthy, albeit tortured. “I am the same person intellectually that I have always been. I know when abnormal things happen to me. I am not some conspiracy theorist as all. I think like a scientist because that is what I am. I am looking for answers on how and why this torture is happening.” Pearson’s revelation might reveal the deepest of dark-sided programs. He points to a federal lawsuit, John St. Clair Akwei v. National Security Agency (Case №1:92-cv-00449), filed on February 20, 1992, in the U.S. District Court for the District of Columbia. “It literally alleged this exact thing. Did anyone — Congress especially — follow up on these allegations ‘cause it seems awfully real for me right now.” 
